{% if embed_actions_in_dialogue and eligible_actions and length(eligible_actions) > 0 %}
{% if render_mode != "thoughts" %}
{% if exists("player") and existsIn(player, "UUID") and exists("npc") and existsIn(npc, "UUID") %}
{#
  Force UDNG's BDSMLOCK category so talk becomes a real lock.
  Category is registered by SkyrimNet_UDNG_Native.dll.
  Drilldown then picks GAGS / COLLARS / CHASTITY_BELTS / ... then EQUIP_*.
  Extra PARAMS keys (target, targetName, device) make the category call FAIL.
  VRTE 0910 still forbids locks if THIS speaker's hands are bound.
  Women only: retarget onto responseTarget only if she is female. A male addressee
  does NOT fall back onto the player (that was the 3.2.4 mislock). _lockWomenOnly
  false omits the lock instructions this turn.
#}
{% set _lockTargetUUID = player.UUID %}
{% set _lockTargetName = player_name %}
{% set _lockWomenOnly = decnpc(player.UUID).isFemale %}
{% if exists("responseTarget") and existsIn(responseTarget, "UUID") and responseTarget.UUID != player.UUID %}
{% if decnpc(responseTarget.UUID).isFemale %}
{% set _lockTargetUUID = responseTarget.UUID %}
{% set _lockTargetName = responseTarget.name %}
{% set _lockWomenOnly = true %}
{% else %}
{% set _lockWomenOnly = false %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% set _fighting = is_in_combat(npc.UUID) or is_in_combat(_lockTargetUUID) %}
{% if not _fighting %}
{% if _lockWomenOnly %}
{% set _gag = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousGag") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zbfWornGag") %}
{% set _collar = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousCollar") %}
{% set _plug = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousPlugVaginal") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousPlugAnal") %}
{% set _nip = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousPiercingsNipple") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousPiercingsVaginal") %}
{% set _belt = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousBelt") %}
{% set _harness = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousHarness") %}
{% set _hands = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousArmbinder") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousYoke") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousHeavyBondage") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousElbowTie") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousArmbinderElbow") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousButterfly") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousStraitJacket") %}
{% set _hood = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousHood") %}
{% set _blind = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousBlindfold") %}
{% set _boots = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousBoots") %}
{% set _bra = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousBra") %}
{% set _corset = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousCorset") %}
{% set _armcuffs = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousArmCuffs") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousCuffsFront") %}
{% set _legcuffs = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousLegCuffs") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousAnkleShackles") %}
{% set _suit = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousSuit") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousPetSuit") %}
{% set _gloves = worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousGloves") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "zad_DeviousBondageMittens") %}
{% set _stillDressed = (worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "ArmorCuirass") or worn_has_keyword(_lockTargetUUID, "ClothingBody")) and not _suit %}
{% set _targetHandsBusy = _hands or _armcuffs %}
{% set _speakerHandsBusy = worn_has_keyword(npc.UUID, "zad_DeviousArmbinder") or worn_has_keyword(npc.UUID, "zad_DeviousYoke") or worn_has_keyword(npc.UUID, "zad_DeviousHeavyBondage") or worn_has_keyword(npc.UUID, "zad_DeviousElbowTie") or worn_has_keyword(npc.UUID, "zad_DeviousArmbinderElbow") or worn_has_keyword(npc.UUID, "zad_DeviousButterfly") or worn_has_keyword(npc.UUID, "zad_DeviousStraitJacket") or worn_has_keyword(npc.UUID, "zad_DeviousArmCuffs") or worn_has_keyword(npc.UUID, "zad_DeviousCuffsFront") or worn_has_keyword(npc.UUID, "zad_DeviousBondageMittens") %}
{% set _speakerCanStrip = (not is_in_combat(npc.UUID)) and (not _speakerHandsBusy) %}

{% if _stillDressed and not _targetHandsBusy %}
## Arms first — {{ _lockTargetName }}
{{ _lockTargetName }} still has clothes and free hands. This line is a behind-the-back restraint, not a gag, not a bra, not a hood. She can still complain.
Currently wears:{% if _collar %} collar.{% endif %}{% if _gag %} gag.{% endif %}{% if _hood %} hood.{% endif %}{% if _blind %} blindfold.{% endif %}{% if _hands %} armbinder/yoke/elbow/butterfly/straitjacket.{% endif %}{% if _armcuffs %} arm cuffs.{% endif %}{% if _bra %} chastity bra.{% endif %}{% if _belt %} chastity belt.{% endif %}{% if not _collar and not _gag and not _hood and not _blind and not _hands and not _armcuffs and not _bra and not _belt %} nothing lockable yet.{% endif %}
ACTION: BDSMLOCK PARAMS: {"intent": "<armbinder|butterfly|elbow binder> {{ _lockTargetName }}"}
`intent` is the ONLY key. Pick one empty behind-the-back word: armbinder, butterfly, or elbow binder. Not arm cuffs. Not gag. Not bra. Clothes after the arms click.
{% else if _stillDressed and _targetHandsBusy and _speakerCanStrip %}
## Clothes — {{ _lockTargetName }}
Hands are already bound. She still wears clothes. This line is cutting them off — **not** another device.
Gag, bra, hood, belt, cuffs, and the rest wait until she is out of the armor.
ACTION: change_outfit_target PARAMS: {"stripped": "{{ _lockTargetName }}", "style": "forcefully", "how": "undresses"}
`Undress` / `change_outfit` only strip YOU. Bound hands do not dress anyone.
{% else %}
## Locking devices on {{ _lockTargetName }} — BDSMLOCK
This always targets {{ _lockTargetName }} — whoever this line is actually addressed to (the player, or another NPC being talked to right now). Do not name a different character in `intent`.
Talking about a gag, collar, or belt does nothing. The lock only happens if you output this category after your spoken line.

## Occupied vs empty slots
Devious Devices is one item per slot. She has one neck, one mouth, one pair of hands. A second collar/gag/binder does nothing except spam. Yanking a leash, saying the collar is locked, walking a collared girl, or talking about her to someone else is NOT a new lock.

Check in this order:
1. Currently wears (never restack these):{% if _collar %} collar.{% endif %}{% if _gag %} gag.{% endif %}{% if _hood %} hood.{% endif %}{% if _blind %} blindfold.{% endif %}{% if _hands %} armbinder/yoke/elbow/butterfly/straitjacket.{% endif %}{% if _armcuffs %} arm cuffs.{% endif %}{% if _legcuffs %} leg cuffs.{% endif %}{% if _gloves %} gloves.{% endif %}{% if _plug %} plug.{% endif %}{% if _nip %} piercings.{% endif %}{% if _belt %} chastity belt.{% endif %}{% if _bra %} chastity bra.{% endif %}{% if _harness %} harness.{% endif %}{% if _corset %} corset.{% endif %}{% if _suit %} catsuit.{% endif %}{% if _boots %} locked boots.{% endif %}{% if not _collar and not _gag and not _hood and not _blind and not _hands and not _armcuffs and not _legcuffs and not _gloves and not _plug and not _nip and not _belt and not _bra and not _harness and not _corset and not _suit and not _boots %} nothing lockable yet.{% endif %}
2. EMPTY (legal to lock this line):{% if not _gag %} gag.{% endif %}{% if not _collar %} collar.{% endif %}{% if not _hood %} hood.{% endif %}{% if not _blind %} blindfold.{% endif %}{% if not _boots %} heels.{% endif %}{% if not _plug %} plug.{% endif %}{% if not _nip %} piercings.{% endif %}{% if not _bra %} chastity bra.{% endif %}{% if not _belt %} chastity belt.{% endif %}{% if not _harness %} harness.{% endif %}{% if not _suit %} catsuit.{% endif %}{% if not _hands %} armbinder / elbow binder / butterfly / yoke / straitjacket.{% endif %}{% if not _armcuffs %} arm cuffs.{% endif %}{% if not _legcuffs %} leg cuffs.{% endif %}{% if not _gloves %} gloves.{% endif %}{% if not _corset %} corset.{% endif %}{% if _gag and _collar and _hood and _blind and _boots and _plug and _nip and _bra and _belt and _harness and _suit and _hands and _armcuffs and _legcuffs and _gloves and _corset %} none — every slot is occupied.{% endif %}
3. Intent map below — only empty slots appear. If a slot word is missing from the map, that slot is occupied; do not name it.

This list is physics. A memory, diary, or bio that says she already wears a chastity belt is STALE if "chastity belt" is not in currently wears. Do NOT skip the lock because Katla's Farm / a previous scene mentioned one.

If she **asked** for an EMPTY slot above, lock that slot this line. Named empty slot beats everything below.

Idea, not a script: arms behind the back, then the clothes, then whatever you like. **Gag and hood last** — let her complain, or leave her talking. Silence is yours to spend, not the opening move.

If `BDSMLOCK` is available and you lock a **missing** slot — she asked for it, or you add the next empty piece — end with ONE line. `intent` is the ONLY key. Name the slot word from this map:
{% if not _gag %}
gag / mouth / silence / ball gag / ring gag / panel gag → GAGS
{% endif %}{% if not _collar %}
collar / leash / posture collar → COLLARS
{% endif %}{% if not _hood %}
hood / mask → HOODS
{% endif %}{% if not _blind %}
blindfold / blind → BLINDFOLDS
{% endif %}{% if not _boots %}
heels / ballet / bondage boots / pony boots → BOOTS
{% endif %}{% if not _plug %}
plug / holes / shocking plug → PLUGS
{% endif %}{% if not _nip %}
piercings / nipple rings / clit piercing → PIERCINGS
{% endif %}{% if not _bra %}
chastity bra / bra / lock tits / chest cage → CHASTITY_BRAS
{% endif %}{% if not _belt %}
chastity belt / belt / lock cunt (no "bra") → CHASTITY_BELTS
{% endif %}{% if not _harness %}
harness → HARNESSES
{% endif %}{% if not _suit %}
catsuit / ebonite suit / rubber suit / latex suit / pet suit / lock her in rubber → SUITS
{% endif %}{% if not _hands %}
armbinder / binder / hands behind → ARMBINDERS
elbow binder / elbows together → ELBOW_BINDERS
butterfly binder / butterfly → BUTTERFLY_BINDERS
yoke → YOKES
straitjacket / strait jacket → STRAITJACKETS
{% endif %}{% if not _armcuffs %}
arm cuffs / wrist cuffs / front cuffs → ARM_CUFFS
{% endif %}{% if not _legcuffs %}
leg cuffs / thigh cuffs / ankle shackles / shackles → LEG_CUFFS
{% endif %}{% if not _gloves %}
